{"id":"f8a4092aca6c1520","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-classNP.md","title":"Complexity class NP","display":"df-classNP — Complexity class NP","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-classNP","aliases":["27-df-classNP"],"display":"df-classNP — Complexity class NP","depends_on":["[[27-df-encoding]]","[[27-df-turing-machine]]","[[27-df-tm-runtime]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"Appendix B.4","source_printed_pages":"619–620","source_pdf_pages":"643–644","verification_status":"source-statement-checked-explicit-polynomial-pairing","local_review_status":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-classNP"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-classNP</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-classNP — Complexity class NP"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"a31024701b006c36\" href=\"?note=a31024701b006c36\" title=\"27-df-turing-machine\">27-df-turing-machine</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"fe90a43e6765ed55\" href=\"?note=fe90a43e6765ed55\" title=\"27-df-tm-runtime\">27-df-tm-runtime</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"Appendix B.4"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"619–620"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"643–644"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked-explicit-polynomial-pairing"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"formally-reviewed-2026-10-20; source-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TM}\">\\(\\mathrm{TM}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Accepts}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Accepts}_M\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"a31024701b006c36\" href=\"?note=a31024701b006c36\" title=\"27-df-turing-machine\">27-df-turing-machine</a>；时间见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fe90a43e6765ed55\" href=\"?note=fe90a43e6765ed55\" title=\"27-df-tm-runtime\">27-df-tm-runtime</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{pair}\">\\(\\mathrm{pair}\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"42004383fb23d1fe\" href=\"?note=42004383fb23d1fe\" title=\"27-df-encoding\">27-df-encoding</a> 中显式构造的二进制配对编码。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Time}_M\">\\(\\mathrm{Time}_M\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"fe90a43e6765ed55\" href=\"?note=fe90a43e6765ed55\" title=\"27-df-tm-runtime\">27-df-tm-runtime</a> 定义的扩充自然数值运行时间。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\langle w,y\\rangle_{\\mathrm b}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{pair}(w,y)\\quad(w,y\\in\\mathbb B^*).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\langle w,y\\rangle_{\\mathrm b}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{pair}(w,y)\\quad(w,y\\in\\mathbb B^*).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{NP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\forall w,y\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(\\mathrm{Time}_M(\\langle w,y\\rangle_{\\mathrm b})\\leq c(|w|+|y|+1)^k)\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(|y|\\leq c(|w|+1)^k\\land\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(\\langle w,y\\rangle_{\\mathrm b}))))\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathbf{NP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\forall w,y\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(\\mathrm{Time}_M(\\langle w,y\\rangle_{\\mathrm b})\\leq c(|w|+|y|+1)^k)\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(|y|\\leq c(|w|+1)^k\\land\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(\\langle w,y\\rangle_{\\mathrm b}))))\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>配对字串可线性编码与解码，排除任意注入配对导致长度膨胀的漏洞。以一个较大的 c,k 同时控制证书长度和验证时间不损失一般性。书中以 D′∈P 给出等价的验证式定义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-encoding]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"a31024701b006c36","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-turing-machine]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-tm-runtime","status":"resolved","id":"fe90a43e6765ed55","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-tm-runtime]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-turing-machine","status":"resolved","id":"a31024701b006c36","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathrm{Accepts}_M$ 见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]；时间见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]。$\\mathrm{pair}$ 是 [[27-df-encoding]] 中显式构造的二进制配对编码。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-tm-runtime","status":"resolved","id":"fe90a43e6765ed55","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathrm{Accepts}_M$ 见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]；时间见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]。$\\mathrm{pair}$ 是 [[27-df-encoding]] 中显式构造的二进制配对编码。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-encoding","status":"resolved","id":"42004383fb23d1fe","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TM}$、$\\mathrm{Accepts}_M$ 见 [[27-df-turing-machine]]；时间见 [[27-df-tm-runtime]]。$\\mathrm{pair}$ 是 [[27-df-encoding]] 中显式构造的二进制配对编码。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-tm-runtime","status":"resolved","id":"fe90a43e6765ed55","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Time}_M$ 是 [[27-df-tm-runtime]] 定义的扩充自然数值运行时间。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{TM}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Accepts}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{pair}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Time}_M","display":false},{"tex":"\\langle w,y\\rangle_{\\mathrm b}\\coloneqq\\mathrm{pair}(w,y)\\quad(w,y\\in\\mathbb B^*).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathbf{NP}\\coloneqq\\{L\\subseteq\\mathbb B^*\\mid\\exists M\\in\\mathrm{TM}\\;\\exists c\\in\\mathbb N^+\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;(\\forall w,y\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(\\mathrm{Time}_M(\\langle w,y\\rangle_{\\mathrm b})\\leq c(|w|+|y|+1)^k)\\land\\forall w\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(w\\in L\\leftrightarrow\\exists y\\in\\mathbb B^*\\;(|y|\\leq c(|w|+1)^k\\land\\mathrm{Accepts}_M(\\langle w,y\\rangle_{\\mathrm b}))))\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1801,"backlinks":[{"id":"d9224d06d4526ac2","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf{NP}$ (complexity class, see [[27-df-classNP]])"},{"id":"f7f088431